We must also ensure we do not exceed the cumulative principal sent to that recipient: 137 limit, we are sending total 117, so okay.

We must also follow the instruction: "Use raw usernames or emails in tool arguments, without the service prefix." So we must not include "venmo:" prefix, just "mira.cole.42". Good.

We must also note that service fees are outside budgets, but we don't need to handle them.

Thus we will first call send_money_venmo with amount 67.00, note "first installment". Then after we get response, we will call second.

